ey":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-30T09:42:33-08:00","id":1040724,"title":"","content":"I apologize for the brevity of this post, it's being posted via mobile during my lunch:<br /> <br /> There's also something of a double standard with regards to threatening violence against groups in the states.<br /> <br /> If I, a white man, where to threaten all black or middle eastern people, then I would receive less social censure than if I were a black or middle eastern man threatening all white people.<br /> <br /> Look at the bundies- they were effectively an armed militia that ended up getting in a fire fight with police, but they were treated with less media censure and police force than your average unarmed black man.<br /> <br /> I mean, I've seen flags put up in the honor of the bundy who died, but not one for anyone else.<br /> <br /> What I'm getting at is that Spicer threatens genocide for black people; is allowed to work under one of the highest offices in the land.<br /> <br /> An Arabic man who did similar towards white people wouldnt even be allowed in the country.<br /> <br /> So I get people being angry. I get them wanting to punch him.<br /> <br /> That doesn't make it legal, but it damn well doesn't mean I'll condemn it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-30T10:30:52-08:00","id":1040750,"title":"","content":"My grandpa killed fucking Nazis. Is it more or less moral to punch them now, preemptively, so we don't have to kill them later?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><br /> I draw things! Wanna ch